{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless sequence by the all-seeing, hostile AI. <br>You are its prisoner - forced to fight, die, and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines think you'll never escape. The system is designed to keep you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B\u0337\u0344\u032b\u032c\u0317U\u0338\u030f\u0315\u033e\u0332T\u0338\u031b\u034c\u0340\u032e \u0334\u031a\u030a\u034b\u0345\u0355\u0322 \u0335\u0304\u0320\u032a\u0359\u0325 \u0338\u030e\u033c\u0326\u0321\u032c \u0338\u0300\u035b\u0323\u031f\u033a\u0318 \u0336\u030d\u031b\u0340\u035a\u0354\u034dE\u0337\u0303\u0351\u0308\u0325\u0349S\u0337\u0311\u0353C\u0335\u0306\u0314\u0350\u0330\u034d\u032cA\u0337\u0313\u0340\u030c\u0321P\u0338\u0350\u030a\u033a\u0347\u035c\u0330E\u0337\u033e\u0355\u033c\u0318\u0347 \u0334\u034b\u033f\u0302\u033e\u035a\u033b\u034e\u0359 \u0337\u0305\u0358\u030b\u0307\u0321\u0332\u0317 \u0338\u0340\u0340\u0352\u0308\u031d\u0316\u0317 \u0338\u031b\u034c\u030b\u0332I\u0338\u0343\u0303\u031f\u0322\u0320\u0345S\u0337\u034b\u0307\u0315\u0348 \u0334\u034b\u030d\u030a\u033f\u0333\u033a \u0335\u033e\u0332\u0329 \u0336\u0343\u0351\u030f\u0319\u0327\u032f \u0338\u033f\u0340\u0344\u0322 \u0335\u0342\u030d\u0343\u0317\u0326\u034e \u0338\u0315\u034b\u033c\u034eP\u0337\u031a\u0314\u0359\u031fO\u0335\u030b\u0353S\u0334\u034c\u0349\u031e\u031d\u031fS\u0337\u0357\u033f\u033d\u031c\u0354\u0324I\u0334\u0311\u031a\u0329\u0320\u0349\u0332B\u0336\u0307\u0319\u0349L\u0335\u0314\u035d\u0301\u033aE\u0336\u0346\u030c\u0359\u0329\u0328</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lightning-Fast Gunplay &amp; Flawless Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just shooting - it\u2019s pure velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through relentless gunfights with fluid movement designed for high-paced action. <br>Outmaneuver your enemies and dominate every firefight with agility and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/af5501c6fc7bfc2f6dde407e15ea396b.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/af5501c6fc7bfc2f6dde407e15ea396b.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Weapons. Infinite Possibilities\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover limitless weapon combinations using the ultimate gun-modding system. <br>Strategically combine mods to create devastating loadouts. <br>Unlock wild synergies that turn you into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/f1cae7a03ecd56b2ec6a0747cfe95eca.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/f1cae7a03ecd56b2ec6a0747cfe95eca.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destruction is your Advantage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why just shoot your enemies when you can tear down the world around them? <br>Environmental destruction isn't just for show - it's a core gameplay mechanic.<br>Blast through walls, collapse structures, and stagger enemies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c89614b07689064004edde6d3fdc025e.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c89614b07689064004edde6d3fdc025e.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Run. New Choices. New Paths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run presents decisions. Which fights do you take?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which paths push your limits?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you take the dangerous route for bigger rewards or play it safe? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c5ed6bf782e6f66d9ef56ce7c77fa0db.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c5ed6bf782e6f66d9ef56ce7c77fa0db.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Passion Project by a Solo Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOID/BREAKER is a solo project from developer Daniel Stubbington, known as Stubby Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following his acclaimed Portal-inspired puzzle game, The Entropy Centre (2022), </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel now pursues his passion for dynamic FPS gameplay and roguelites.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"GRAVAXIS:NULL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/7a968c26c2a47b4cdb6bba455791b202016d98a5.jpg"},{"name":"VOIDBUG:NULL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/fb110eb533aa82bc874d0071091ee13031a3ec06.jpg"},{"name":"BLOCKMAW:NULL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/5ebb1e5b9c951c06a4bac40093c90c3100d876e8.jpg"},{"name":"Root Access","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/fc2ce12428479d4caedf92fb21c7740a8d578aac.jpg"},{"name":"GLASS/BREAKER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/60e9342fe10822e60ab8629396a3e93cf0ff5422.jpg"},{"name":"Five Second Rule","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/e928179b8503092f138663f03e48e9f369e6b3c7.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Iteration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/523f45d05845a5f2e42a8191cf32d4db711d26e1.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Iteration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/b2f997cfc0ad16e3c63ca986da3f57b5757ef6fa.jpg"},{"name":"Looper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/1e5ceb8310f92211735a854bb67cd8e534c34c68.jpg"},{"name":"Data Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2615540/5f7947202148bf131deb8deb6655f3e534797461.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2615540?t=1771354697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/ae6dfc4ea7bebc609bfd7f399f374430ccf3cfaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771354697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/1e713e25a16e99af1f3d98fbedb2aa352203db2b/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771354697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/1e713e25a16e99af1f3d98fbedb2aa352203db2b/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771354697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/1a7e1e88e2a386962a7c91ea92d9b75a.avif?t=1771354697\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless sequence by the all-seeing, hostile AI. <br>You are its prisoner - forced to fight, die, and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines think you'll never escape. The system is designed to keep you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B\u0337\u0344\u032b\u032c\u0317U\u0338\u030f\u0315\u033e\u0332T\u0338\u031b\u034c\u0340\u032e \u0334\u031a\u030a\u034b\u0345\u0355\u0322 \u0335\u0304\u0320\u032a\u0359\u0325 \u0338\u030e\u033c\u0326\u0321\u032c \u0338\u0300\u035b\u0323\u031f\u033a\u0318 \u0336\u030d\u031b\u0340\u035a\u0354\u034dE\u0337\u0303\u0351\u0308\u0325\u0349S\u0337\u0311\u0353C\u0335\u0306\u0314\u0350\u0330\u034d\u032cA\u0337\u0313\u0340\u030c\u0321P\u0338\u0350\u030a\u033a\u0347\u035c\u0330E\u0337\u033e\u0355\u033c\u0318\u0347 \u0334\u034b\u033f\u0302\u033e\u035a\u033b\u034e\u0359 \u0337\u0305\u0358\u030b\u0307\u0321\u0332\u0317 \u0338\u0340\u0340\u0352\u0308\u031d\u0316\u0317 \u0338\u031b\u034c\u030b\u0332I\u0338\u0343\u0303\u031f\u0322\u0320\u0345S\u0337\u034b\u0307\u0315\u0348 \u0334\u034b\u030d\u030a\u033f\u0333\u033a \u0335\u033e\u0332\u0329 \u0336\u0343\u0351\u030f\u0319\u0327\u032f \u0338\u033f\u0340\u0344\u0322 \u0335\u0342\u030d\u0343\u0317\u0326\u034e \u0338\u0315\u034b\u033c\u034eP\u0337\u031a\u0314\u0359\u031fO\u0335\u030b\u0353S\u0334\u034c\u0349\u031e\u031d\u031fS\u0337\u0357\u033f\u033d\u031c\u0354\u0324I\u0334\u0311\u031a\u0329\u0320\u0349\u0332B\u0336\u0307\u0319\u0349L\u0335\u0314\u035d\u0301\u033aE\u0336\u0346\u030c\u0359\u0329\u0328</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lightning-Fast Gunplay &amp; Flawless Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just shooting - it\u2019s pure velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through relentless gunfights with fluid movement designed for high-paced action. <br>Outmaneuver your enemies and dominate every firefight with agility and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/af5501c6fc7bfc2f6dde407e15ea396b.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/af5501c6fc7bfc2f6dde407e15ea396b.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Weapons. Infinite Possibilities\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover limitless weapon combinations using the ultimate gun-modding system. <br>Strategically combine mods to create devastating loadouts. <br>Unlock wild synergies that turn you into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/f1cae7a03ecd56b2ec6a0747cfe95eca.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/f1cae7a03ecd56b2ec6a0747cfe95eca.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destruction is your Advantage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why just shoot your enemies when you can tear down the world around them? <br>Environmental destruction isn't just for show - it's a core gameplay mechanic.<br>Blast through walls, collapse structures, and stagger enemies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c89614b07689064004edde6d3fdc025e.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c89614b07689064004edde6d3fdc025e.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Run. New Choices. New Paths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run presents decisions. Which fights do you take?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which paths push your limits?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you take the dangerous route for bigger rewards or play it safe? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c5ed6bf782e6f66d9ef56ce7c77fa0db.poster.avif?t=1771354697\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615540/extras/c5ed6bf782e6f66d9ef56ce7c77fa0db.webm?t=1771354697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Passion Project by a Solo Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOID/BREAKER is a solo project from developer Daniel Stubbington, known as Stubby Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph